        },
        rules: {
          objective: 'Score 11 points (or 21) before opponents. Points come from special cards, counting cards, and spades.',
          gameplay: "On your turn, play exactly one card from your hand by:\n1. Pairing: If your card matches a table card's rank, capture both.\n2. Combining: If your card equals the arithmetic sum of 2+ table cards, capture them all.\n3. Building: Lay your hand card with table cards, announce the intended total. Another player cannot steal the build unless they match it first.\n4. Trailing: If you can't or won't capture/build, simply lay a card face-up on the table.",
          keyRules: [
            'Face cards (J, Q, K) have no numeric value for combining; they can only pair.',
            'Aces = 1 (or 14 in Royal Cassino variant).',
            "A 'sweep' (clearing entire tableau) earns 1 bonus point. The sweeping card is turned face-up to track sweeps.",
            'All table cards not captured go to the last player who made any capture.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: "Always capture Big Cassino (10â™¦) and Little Cassino (2â™ ) when possibleâ€”combined they're 3 points. Never let them sit on the table unguarded.",
          intermediate: "Build Management: Build toward a number you hold in your hand. Don't announce a build unless you're confident no opponent holds the matching capture card. Monitor the count of cards you've capturedâ€”crossing 27 cards triggers the Most Cards bonus (3 pts).",
          advanced: 'Sweep Timing: Set up a sweep (clearing the table) within 2-3 turns by building so all table cards combine into your target number. Track all four Acesâ€”each is a point. In 2-player, count the spades gone to predict whether you or your opponent will hit the 7-spade threshold.',
          tips: [
            'Never trail a card that creates an easy capture opportunity for your opponent.',
            'Keep track of cards captured throughout the hand, not just at scoring.',
            'In partnership play, coordinate to deny opponents Big/Little Cassino.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
